{
	"_comment": [
		"Hand-written Montenegrin for the strings HikaShop has no word for. Merged over the ones taken",
		"from HikaShop's own srp-ME file by tools/build-locales.mjs, so regenerating keeps these.",
		"Started from the Serbian Latin catalogue, then corrected to ijekavian, which is what makes it",
		"Montenegrin rather than Serbian in the same alphabet: cijena not cena, izmjene not izmene,",
		"obavještenja not obaveštenja, sedmica not nedjelja for a week. Procenat stays as it is: the",
		"ije rule applies to words, not to letters that happen to sit inside one.",
		"Maintained here rather than generated: the corrections are not mechanical, and a later fix to",
		"the Serbian must not silently undo them.",
		"Montenegrin counts in three, as Serbian does: 1 varijanta, 2 varijante, 5 varijanti."
	],
